baba is a small game that aims to mimic the mechanics of "Baba is You", a game by Arvi Teikari.
The impetus is purely the technical challenge.
Art is redrawn (poorly) by me. No assets from the actual game are used.

Controls:
- WASD for movement
- Enter to enter a level
- Backspace to leave a level
- Z to undo

Currently supported:
- IS
- YOU
- STOP
- PUSH
- WIN
- SELECT
- SINK
- DEFEAT
...plus a bunch of nouns.

Behaviour between this reimplementation and the retail game is expected to be very similar, but not exact.
There are too many edge cases to consider :-)
